
Starts a local web server on `127.0.0.1:8080` (or specified port). While running, press `R` then Enter to rebuild the project.

### Other commands

- `ploogly licenses` – show third-party license information.

## Project structure

- `project.ssg` – main configuration file with variables.
- `site/` – source files (templates, markdown, etc.).
- `out/site/` – generated static site.

